    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"meaning\" is just something we make up to distract ourselves, right? if you look at it from a purely logical perspective, there's no objective reason to prefer existence over non-existence. if the net value of life is zero, then choosing to end it is just as valid as choosing to stay. it's just a neutral choice between two states.",
